etstryck + 0,1 MPa (lägst 0,25); rampen beställs med P/E-kod G/H/J (sida 404).","message_en":"External pilot (R): operating pressure −100 kPa…0.7 MPa (4-position 0.6; metal seal high pressure 1.0) with a pilot pressure of 0.25–0.7 MPa; for the 4-position dual 3-port valve at least operating pressure + 0.1 MPa (min. 0.25); the manifold is ordered with P/E symbol G/H/J (page 404).","goto_step":"sy-plugin-pilot"},{"severity":"info","if_json":{"==":[{"var":"check"},"H"]},"message_sv":"Inbyggd backventil (H): hindrar mottryck från andra ventiler på samma ramp; kombinera inte med den rampmonterade backventilen — flödet minskar (sida 432).","message_en":"Built-in back pressure check valve (H): prevents back pressure from other valves on the same manifold; do not combine with the manifold installed check valve — the flow is reduced (page 432).","goto_step":"sy-plugin-check"},{"severity":"info","if_json":{"==":[{"var":"option"},"B"]},"message_sv":"B: Snabb respons (0,7 MPa) — effekt 0,9 W (0,95 W med ljus) i stället för 0,35 W (sida 404).","message_en":"B: quick response type (0.7 MPa) — power 0.9 W (0.95 W with light) instead of 0.35 W (page 404).","goto_step":"sy-plugin-option"},{"severity":"info","if_json":{"==":[{"var":"option"},"K"]},"message_sv":"K: Högtryck 1,0 MPa (bara metalltätning) — effekt 0,9 W (0,95 W med ljus) i stället för 0,35 W (sida 404).","message_en":"K: high pressure type 1.0 MPa (metal seal only) — power 0.9 W (0.95 W with light) instead of 0.35 W (page 404).","goto_step":"sy-plugin-option"},{"severity":"info","if_json":{"==":[{"var":"coil"},"T"]},"message_sv":"Strömsparkrets (T): hålleffekt 0,1 W efter 67 ms (0,4 W högtryck), välj den vid långa inkopplingstider; högst 5 Hz och spänningstolerans −7/+10 % vid 24 V (sida 404 och 705).","message_en":"Power saving circuit (T): holding power 0.1 W after 67 ms (0.4 W high pressure), select it for long energising times; max. 5 Hz and voltage tolerance −7/+10 % at 24 V (pages 404 and 705).","goto_step":"sy-plugin-coil"},{"severity":"info","if_json":{"==":[{"var":"light"},"R"]},"message_sv":"R: skyddsdiod, opolär — passar båda polariteterna; på EX600-rampen krävs 24 V och en skyddsdiod (Nil finns inte där) (sida 504).","message_en":"R: surge voltage suppressor, non-polar — fits both commons; on the EX600 manifold 24 V and a surge suppressor are required (blank is not available there) (page 504).","goto_step":"sy-plugin-light"},{"severity":"info","if_json":{"==":[{"var":"light"},"U"]},"message_sv":"U: ljus och skyddsdiod, opolär — passar båda polariteterna; på EX600-rampen krävs 24 V och en skyddsdiod (Nil finns inte där) (sida 504).","message_en":"U: light and surge voltage suppressor, non-polar — fits both commons; on the EX600 manifold 24 V and a surge suppressor are required (blank is not available there) (page 504).","goto_step":"sy-plugin-light"}]'::jsonb) r;

